<title>JAPAN: Minato Electronics - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Minato Electronics - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.34		vs	    2.98</p>
<p> Operating    loss 63 million	 vs	prft 166 million</p>
<p> Current	loss 39 million	 vs	prft 123 million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 52 million	 vs	 prft 36 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 5.80 yen	  vs     prft 4.02 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   9 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Minato Electronics Inc is a manufacturer of electronic equipment.</p>
</text>
